        "title": "Beatmap backgrounds in the main menu",
        "body": "We might want to add an ability to allow players select beatmap backgrounds instead of default in the main menu.\r\nSince we have an ability to skin that, we can make a dropdown in settings like\r\n\r\nMain menu background\r\n- default\r\n- skin\r\n- beatmap\r\n- seasonal (in the future)\r\n\r\nSome elements like \"skin\" and \"beatmap\" will be visible for supporters only (or not).\r\n",
